File Role <code>conduit.yaml</code> Two pools, <code>data_sources</code>, request rule <code>data/routing.csv</code> qname → pool name <code>scripts/route-by-table.rhai</code> <code>table_lookup</code> + <code>set_pool</code> <p><code>data/routing.csv</code>:</p> <pre><code>qname,pool
app-a.customer.example.,premium
app-b.customer.example.,standard
</code></pre> <p><code>scripts/route-by-table.rhai</code>:</p> <pre><code>let pool = table_lookup("routing", question_qname(txn));
if pool != "" {
    txn.set_pool(pool);
}
</code></pre> <p>On a CSV miss, the script leaves pool choice unchanged — Conduit uses the default pool for that query.</p>
